{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07319","headline":"奉和杜相公新移长兴宅呈元相公 · 刘长卿","name":"奉和杜相公新移长兴宅呈元相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"间世生贤宰，同心奉至尊。\n功高开北第，机静灌中园。\n入并蝉冠影，归分骑士喧。\n窗闻汉宫漏，家识杜陵源。\n献替常焚藁，优闲独对萱。\n花香逐荀令，草色对王孙。\n有地先开阁，何人不扫门。\n江湖难自退，明主托元元。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}